          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "亞雷斯,趕快再來比一場!昨天輸給你,我越想越不甘心!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "贏了就是贏了,何況你已經打贏我十幾場,讓我一場有什麼關係!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "這可不一樣!我老爸說過,劍技要不斷磨練才會進步....."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "拜託,今天休息吧!風和日麗的日子,躺在草地上曬曬太陽,不是也很愜意?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "好吧,既然如此,我回去找侍衛們練習也可以!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/1/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "咦,那是什麼東西?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/1/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "怎麼了?"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/1"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "郊外救起失憶少女"
