      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "好像是人昏倒在地呢!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "是啊,旁邊那個大傢伙又是什麼?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "蓋亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/2",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/2",
          "text": "不要再接近!否則我將照規定採取防衛行動!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "搞什麼嘛!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮(少女)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/4",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/4",
          "text": "嗯,好痛....."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "是女孩子呢!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "我去看看!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "小..小姐,你沒事吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮(少女)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/8",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/8",
          "text": "你..你是誰?這裡是哪裡?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "這裡是羅特帝亞,我叫索爾,請問小姐你的芳名?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "note": "自稱「悠妮」,確認此代碼即幼年悠妮,與正篇全域索引 4=亞雷斯 無關",
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮(少女)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/10",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/10",
          "text": "我叫..我叫..悠妮吧。我怎麼會來到這裡的?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "悠妮?好名字。悠妮小姐,妳怎麼會記不得怎麼來到這裡的?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮(少女)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/12",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/12",
          "text": "....真的想不起來了,只記得..只記得我好像是從很遠很遠的地方來的。蓋亞?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "蓋亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/13",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/13",
          "text": "是的,主人。有何吩咐?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮(少女)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/14",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/14",
          "text": "我們..是從哪裡來的?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "蓋亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/15",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/15",
          "text": "據我的慣性導航系統顯示,是在那個方位。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/16",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "啊!我知道了,你們是從馬拉大陸來的,我聽老爸說過,那的確是個很遙遠的地方。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/17",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "悠妮小姐,妳是從那個馬..馬拉大陸來的嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮(少女)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/18",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/18",
          "text": "我記不得了,只記得..好可怕的惡夢..好可怕..不!不要!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/19",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "悠..悠妮小姐!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮(少女)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/20",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/20",
          "text": "我好怕..帶我回家..帶我回家,好嗎?求求你...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/21",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "..好!好!別怕,有我在..放心,我一定帶妳回家!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2/lines/22",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "哎喲喂!這小子該不會想要....."
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/2"
    },
    {
