          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/3/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "這?好..好吧,我回去問問老爹,我想他應該會知道....."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/3/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "好極了,我們整理一些輕便行李,我再向父王稟告一下,就可以出發了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾(少年)"
