          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾(少年)"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/8cbcda4a2315/scenes/3/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "不用謝了,你先帶悠妮小姐回去休養吧!陛下那邊和借船的事我來辦就好了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾(少年)"
            }
          },
